From: Anaconda Recipes <build@anaconda.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 13:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 0043] Wire system protobuf via protobuf_bazel_repo

Introduce a protobuf_bazel_repo repository rule that copies bazel rules from
protobuf-bazel-rules (PROTOBUF_BAZEL_DIR) and links against host libprotobuf.
Protoc at PREFIX/bin/protoc generates C++ code consistent with the installed
protobuf headers and runtime libraries.

